WEBVTT

00:04:28.389 --> 00:04:31.267
Or— perhaps most painfully—
cautery,

00:04:31.267 --> 00:04:34.895
which involved lancing the lymph nodes
with a red-hot poker

00:04:34.895 --> 00:04:37.440
to release the blackened pus within.

00:04:38.357 --> 00:04:40.526
A lot has changed since their times.

00:04:40.609 --> 00:04:43.946
Modern medicine has given us the means
to quickly identify

00:04:43.946 --> 00:04:46.365
bacterial as well as viral threats

00:04:46.365 --> 00:04:48.534
and to effectively mobilize against them.

00:04:49.118 --> 00:04:52.163
We also have access to technologies
like test kits,

00:04:52.163 --> 00:04:56.250
masks to deter the spread 
of respiratory viruses, and vaccines;

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:59.920
and we conduct robust trials to make
sure they’re safe and effective.